      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout single\" data-layout=\"single\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"BahmniAdministration-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">This section of the guide talks about various Administration tasks that can be performed with Bahmni.  Please also refer the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3091300353/Security+Guide\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3091300353\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"><strong>Security Guide</strong></a>.<br/></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout three-equal\" data-layout=\"three-equal\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"75cc2741-ab64-44c9-b537-0a202bfb8299\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Sections</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"732cbb91-19f7-496e-b770-b5f0ec9c6633\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/116004566/Importing+and+Exporting+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116004566\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Importing and Exporting Data</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/18415806/Configure+CSV+Import\" data-linked-resource-id=\"18415806\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure CSV Import</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/13697066/Migrate+Patient+and+Encounter+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"13697066\" data-linked-resour